@node dokgen_utils
@section (dokgen utils)

@c %start of fragment

This module defines helper procedures that didn't quite fit anywhere
else.


@c %end of fragment

@c %start of fragment

@subsection Procedures

@c %start of fragment

@deffn Procedure min-indent string
Return the shorter number of spaces used for indentation in the given
string.

This procedure assumes indentation is space-based, not tab-based.

@strong{string} (string): The text to inspect.

@strong{Return value} (integer): The number of spaces representing the
shorter indentation.

@end deffn


@c %end of fragment

@c %start of fragment

@deffn Procedure tabs->spaces string OPT: tabsize
Convert tabs to spaces in the given string.

@strong{string} (string): The original text.

@strong{tabsize} (integer): Optional.  The number of spaces that will
replace a single tab.  If not provided, @var{DEFAULT_SPACE_INDENT_SIZE}
is used.

@strong{Return value} (string): A new string where all tabs are replaced
by spaces.

@end deffn


@c %end of fragment

@c %start of fragment

@deffn Procedure trim string spaces
Trim off the given number of spaces at the beginning of the string.

@strong{string} (string): The original text.

@strong{spaces} (integer): The number of spaces to trim off.

@strong{Return value} (string): A new string with the exact number of
spaces removed, if they exist.  Otherwise, the original string is
returned.

@end deffn


@c %end of fragment

@c %start of fragment

@deffn Procedure unindent docstring
Remove unwanted indentation from the given documentation string.

'Unwanted' indentation is what results, for example, from aligning
documentation lines to the first line of the documentation string so
that they look aesthetic in the source code.

@strong{docstring} (string): A string that documents a procedure or any
other object.

@strong{Return value} (string): A new string with the undesired
indentation removed.

@end deffn


@c %end of fragment

@c %end of fragment

@c %start of fragment

@subsection Variables

@c %start of fragment

@defvr Variable DEFAULT_SPACE_INDENT_SIZE
@verbatim 
2
@end verbatim

@end defvr


@c %end of fragment

